Scoped chromakey and chromahold YUV colour keying

The option tables, the chromakey_fmts and hold_pixel_fmts negotiation lists, the
RGB_TO_U/RGB_TO_V key conversion, the one-slice 3x3 chroma neighbourhood alpha and the
chroma hold in src/video-chromakey.ts, src/video-ops/chromakey.ts and
src/video-ops/chromahold.ts follow libavfilter/vf_chromakey.c (do_chromakey_pixel,
get_pixel_uv, do_chromakey_slice, do_chromahold_slice, filter_frame, config_output,
config_input, chromakey_options, chromahold_options, chromakey_fmts, hold_pixel_fmts),
with the AV_OPT_TYPE_FLOAT and AV_OPT_TYPE_BOOL range checks of libavutil/opt.c and the
generic threads option of libavfilter/avfilter.c (ff_filter_get_nb_threads).
Colours are parsed by parseColor in @edge-ffmpeg/avutil (av_parse_color).
